 xi = 27 + eta_0 = 32.368923; xi 3^l/2^(d_l) = m_l + eta_l for all l < K: True; l = 10: m = 103, eta = 13.6597, x = 116.6597
== (E2) the infimum over infinite words is the all-ones value 1; largest partial eta_0 over no-descent words of length 12 ==
 largest partial eta_0 over no-descent words of length 12: 2.9518 (words hugging the critical line from below); all-ones value: 0.9923
