== minus sheet (3x-1 map): the same recursion, real shadow x = m - eta, cycles 1, 5, 17 ==
 3x-1 cycle through 1: (m, eta) = [(1, '1'), (1, '1'), (1, '1')] ... m - eta = 0 at every point: True
 3x-1 cycle through 5: (m, eta) = [(5, '5'), (7, '7'), (5, '5')] ... m - eta = 0 at every point: True
 3x-1 cycle through 17: (m, eta) = [(17, '17'), (25, '25'), (37, '37')] ... m - eta = 0 at every point: True
 3x-1 orbit of 3 reaches 1 after 1 steps: R(d) = 3 = n: True (eventually periodic word: real value equals the 2-adic value)
 3x-1 orbit of 11 reaches 1 after 1 steps: R(d) = 11 = n: True (eventually periodic word: real value equals the 2-adic value)
 3x-1 orbit of 29 reaches 1 after 2 steps: R(d) = 29 = n: True (eventually periodic word: real value equals the 2-adic value)
